  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Aura</strong> strong Creation; <strong>CL</strong> 15th<br>\n<strong>Slot</strong> hands; <strong>Price</strong> 50,000 gp; <strong>Weight</strong> 0.5 lbs.</p>\n<p><strong>Description</strong><br>\nThe master of creative arts is a metallic glove-like object that covers the fingers with several rings attached to each other by chains. When worn, the glove functions as a +1 Creation implement, and grants the wearer the Exquisite Detail and Forge talents.</p>\n<p><strong>Construction Requirements</strong><br>\nCraft Implement Of Power, Creation sphere (Exquisite Detail, Forge (alter)); <strong>Cost</strong> 25,000 gp</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/implements#toc19\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
